     {"doi":"10.1038/s41598-022-25638-9","version":"version of record with 2024 author correction","title":"Sparse inference and active learning of stochastic differential equations from data","authors":["Yunfei Huang","Youssef Mabrouk","Gerhard Gompper","Benedikt Sabass"],"journal":"Scientific Reports","volume":"12","article":"21691","published":"2022-12-15","abstract":"Automatic threshold sparse Bayesian learning identifies drift and diffusion libraries, while feedback perturbations improve global SDE inference in multistable simulations.","comment":"Author Correction 10.1038/s41598-024-57801-9 (2024-03-29) supplements the Data Availability statement; scientific results unchanged"},
     [sec("作者信息", "作者 Yunfei Huang、Youssef Mabrouk、Gerhard Gompper、Benedikt Sabass；Scientific Reports 12, 21691 (2022)，DOI:10.1038/s41598-022-25638-9。核验17页开放期刊版及2024 Author Correction 10.1038/s41598-024-57801-9；更正补充Data Availability，不改变结果。"),
      sec("研究问题", "从有限含噪轨迹识别ODE/PDE/SDE时，候选函数库通常高度共线，稀疏阈值又依赖人工调参；多稳态轨迹还可能只覆盖一个basin。论文问：Bayesian Laplace prior能否自动选择稀疏项并给不确定度，以及反馈施加小扰动能否主动探索未采样区域以恢复全局Langevin方程？"),
      sec("背景", "Kramers–Moyal系数由短时间增量估计：一阶对应drift，二阶对应diffusion。把候选函数在数据点上的值组成library Θ，未知系数ξ进入线性逆问题。Automatic threshold sparse Bayesian learning（ATSBL）用Laplacian prior促进稀疏并迭代删除低可信项。", "Figure 1以一维SDE展示从轨迹、binned KM estimates到正确drift/diffusion terms的恢复，并比较Laplacian与Gaussian prior的数据效率。"),
      sec("模型与方法", "作者先用Euler–Maruyama生成已知SDE轨迹，估计conditional moments并按state bins平均；ATSBL同时拟合D(1)与D(2)。随后扩展到time-dependent SDE、Lorenz ODE和PDE，以已知真值评估coefficient error与term selection。", "AISO主动学习循环根据当前模型的不确定性构造外力，使轨迹访问信息不足区域；每轮收集新数据、减去已知控制力并重估方程。控制只在模拟中施加，且假定可测状态与可加控制通道已知。"),
      sec("核心结果与证据", "Figure 1的一维多项式drift/diffusion例中，ATSBL在作者的采样范围内恢复正确非零项和近真值系数；Laplacian prior比Gaussian prior用更少数据达到低误差。该比较依赖候选库含真项和所用阈值/噪声模型。", "Figure 2显示time-dependent force及短trajectory下的adaptive binning能改善KM估计。有限sampling interval会产生系统偏差，作者明确指出需要finite-time corrections；本文重点不是消除这类偏差。", "Figure 3的二维多井势中，被动轨迹长时间困于单井，局部模型对其他区域错误；AISO逐轮降低uncertainty并增加跨saddle rare events，使global drift coefficients接近真值。这是已知模拟系统的闭环验证，不是实验自主发现。"),
      sec("有效性与局限", "稀疏恢复假设真实方程位于候选library；遗漏项、共线性、measurement noise或隐藏变量会造成错误结构。KM估计需要Markov近似、足够小采样间隔和充分bin occupancy；高维时binning与library规模迅速增长。", "AISO需要能够安全、近似加性地操纵系统并知道控制力；真实实验可能有delay、state constraints和control-dependent noise。作者更正只补充代码/数据位置，不增强科学验证。"),
      sec("复现与资源", "期刊：https://doi.org/10.1038/s41598-022-25638-9；更正：https://doi.org/10.1038/s41598-024-57801-9；代码与数据：https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.10732552。核验PDF SHA-256：5aaa46b06fb6edc96dbb68f102ca8921959ebb49ae753ff6e98a2118d828e466。", "复现需固定dt、trajectory length、bins、library、prior、threshold iterations、control cost、uncertainty metric与seeds。Evidence status: full-text verified corrected record; no independent reproduction performed."),
      sec("阅读指南", "先读 pp.2–7的KM、library与ATSBL公式，再看 p.9 Figure 1的一维验证；p.10–11 Figure 2检查sampling/binning，p.12 Figure 3是主动学习主结果。最后读Discussion和2024 correction，区分算法结构、模拟性能与数据声明更新。")],
     "figure-1-sde-inference.webp","Figure 1",10,"comparison","一维SDE轨迹、漂移/扩散估计、稀疏恢复方程及prior误差比较。","ATSBL把含噪Kramers–Moyal估计投影到稀疏候选库并恢复已知一维SDE。","Figure 1完整展示从随机轨迹、条件矩估计到稀疏可解释方程及误差比较的基础验证。",
     [{"label":"Kramers–Moyal coefficients","latex":r"D^{(n)}(x)=\frac{1}{n!}\lim_{\tau\to0}\frac{\langle[X(t+\tau)-X(t)]^n\mid X(t)=x\rangle}{\tau}","role":"estimate drift and diffusion from conditional increments","symbols":{"D1":"drift","D2":"diffusion coefficient","tau":"sampling lag"},"evidence":"paper.pdf p. 2, Eq. (2)","interpretation":"Finite lag and sparse occupancy bias these estimates unless their limits are controlled."},{"label":"Sparse library model","latex":r"\mathcal F_\ell(Z)=\Theta(Z)\boldsymbol\xi_\ell","role":"cast equation discovery as sparse linear inference","symbols":{"Theta":"candidate-function library","xi":"sparse coefficients"},"evidence":"paper.pdf p. 3, Eqs. (3)–(4)","interpretation":"Interpretability is conditional on the true terms being represented in the library."}],
